            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A cave? (गुफ़ा, gufā.) A palace? (महल, mahal.) A fort? (क़िला, qilā.) A tower? (मीनार, mīnār.) A garden? (बाग़, bāg.) A zoo? (चिड़ियाघर, ciṛiyāghar.) A museum? (संग्रहालय, saṅgrahālay.) A tunnel? (सुरंग, suraṅg.) A bicycle? (साइकिल, sāikil.) A scooter? (स्कूटर, skūṭar.) A lorry? (ट्रक, ṭrak.) A rickshaw? (रिक्शा, rikśā.) An aeroplane? (हवाई जहाज़, havāī jahāz.) Petrol? (पेट्रोल, peṭrol.) A telephone? (फ़ोन, phon.) A letter? (पत्र, patra.) An envelope? (लिफ़ाफ़ा, lifāfā.) A ticket office? (टिकट घर, ṭikaṭ ghar.) A message? (संदेसा, sandesā.) A conversation? (बातचीत, bātcīt.)"
            }
